e in the show  now actually think about that think  about all the changes that were made in  the show  out of all those changes george r  martin's number one wish was that they  would have included lady stoneheart  if he doesn't care about spoiling his  own character's storyline  then why should dan and dave if this  doesn't tell you that lady stoneheart is  a significant character then i don't  know what will  don't hold back folks let me hear what  you have to say about this revelation  i will see you down in the comments  section i want to thank everyone for  watching the video  thank all of you for continuing to  support the channel i hope everyone has  a great  day i will see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  so  you

